      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTIA.\nThus hath the candle sing’d the moth.\nO, these deliberate fools! When they do choose,\nThey have the wisdom by their wit to lose.",
