      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTIA.\nNo more, I pray thee. I am half afeard\nThou wilt say anon he is some kin to thee,\nThou spend’st such high-day wit in praising him.\nCome, come, Nerissa, for I long to see\nQuick Cupid’s post that comes so mannerly.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
